keywords:
  - performance measurement
  - legal deposit libraries
  - online reviews
  - sentiment analysis
  - importance-performance analysis
abstract: >-
  Code that turns public Google Maps reviews into library performance indicators: cleaning of
  platform-generated text, sentiment scoring with validation against a second lexicon and star
  ratings, sentence-level classification into four service dimensions, and importance-performance
  analysis using both stated and derived importance.
